      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable that you feel a sense of betrayal when your foundational beliefs crumble; it's a massive shift in reality. The idea of \"just moving on\" feels impossible when the groundwork of your life has dissolved, so please don't feel pressured to find meaning right now. Instead, focus on just getting through the next moment, allowing yourself to navigate this feeling of being unmoored without needing an answer for everything yet.",
