    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential despair and disillusionment after their core beliefs have collapsed, eventually suggesting that letting everything \"collapse\" feels more logical than rebuilding. The assistant provides empathetic responses that validate the user's feelings of emptiness and hopelessness.",
